{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a4891c4e65a0186097311553fc5e1c07b1c34a9078af0d6f57772eca36ab2c74", "ja": "全体公演に向け、動き出すアイドル達。力を\n合わせてレッスンをこなし、準備を整えてい\nく。見る夢の形は少しずつ違っても、目指す\n場所は同じ。手を取り合って向かったステー\nジは、夢のような輝きを放つのだった。", "zh": "偶像们为了全体公演展开行动，同心协力完成\n训练课程，逐步做好公演的准备。\n尽管大家的梦想不尽相同，目标仍然一致。\n众人手牵手一同迈向的舞台，\n绽放着如梦似幻的光彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1000_p", "source_sha256": "453dc17137ae1064c4cc8a602a01862b018641e779bf637e67b06cc99a9911cb", "ja": "（こうして、全体公演に向けて\n劇場のアイドル全員が動き出したわけだが……）", "zh": "（就这样，为了准备全体公演，\n剧场的偶像全都动起来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5181d6bd3bb3a3414e21a7ef7e303093e3046ec2c616e2b4f0c26fcbdfb7261", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れ様なのです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n你辛苦了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e49d064133335d205daf1d9a8c1af8777c963202d20238f483ad74eeb684b76d", "ja": "……あれ？　3人とも、今日は\nバラエティのロケに直行じゃなかったか？", "zh": "……咦？你们三个今天不是要直接去\n出综艺节目的外景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "c4316928df2a8d253ab894a83e34d521da24b5ae170bf04dde2e899879e4a18b", "ja": "はい、ですが出発まで少し時間があるので、\n自主レッスンをしていたんです。", "zh": "是的，不过离出发还有一点时间，\n所以我们刚刚在自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "631e7d7344f2c80f22118bea8cff08e1c617e924398822db62d3e31cc5fe32c5", "ja": "おかげで2時間みっちり、教えてもらうことが\nできました。……主に、徳川さんに。", "zh": "多亏有这段空档，我们充实练习了两个小时。\n……主要是请德川姊指导我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "cb22f12f9e7cf2d5cbd0fa76b5aaaec3c47db212601026958d3ca2b4e0e0a5f8", "ja": "はいほー！　せっかくの全体公演なので、\nみんなで姫と一緒に、ふわふわステップを踊るのです♪", "zh": "Hi Ho！因为是难得的全体公演，\n大家要跟公主一起跳出轻飘飘的舞步喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0b370d9280cef287868b209c7fdd8a52c7d4848d258024c291621254fdc43eb5", "ja": "そうだったのか。……どんなステップかわからないが、\n楽しみにしてるよ！", "zh": "原来如此……虽然不知道那是什么样的舞步，\n但我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1007_p", "source_sha256": "66fb5cade28f11425384d6612bde9556e3bb7d5c63cc893f0fbe09138758555a", "ja": "でも、まだレッスンルームの方から声がするけど。\nもしかして、誰か居残りしてるのか？", "zh": "不过，练习室那里还有声音传出来。\n难道说有人留在里面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e3566d5c16ce4f6f119fe154a2f1e5d8b301d2fdee6b6342604a8a1ded35957", "ja": "あ、このみさん達がランニングから帰って来たんだと\n思います！　ありさ達と入れ替わりのハズですから。", "zh": "啊，应该是木实姊她们慢跑结束回来了！\n她们要接在亚利沙我们之后用练习室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1009_p", "source_sha256": "56b784c63607effb5b82299d97cb479e87d2c3cb179b58b55231b7f7d0c49519", "ja": "へえ、ずいぶんかっちりしたスケジュールだな。\nしかし、他の子の分も把握してるとは、さすが……。", "zh": "哦，行程安排得很紧密呢。\n而且其他人的行程也在你的掌握之中，不愧是亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "4bee0fe28dde668bc42e999b3aeca2b7e555a053f04f31ecd2f453be336031ba", "ja": "はっ、今回はありさが調べたわけじゃありませんよ？\n計画表で決まってるんです♪", "zh": "啊，这次亚利沙可没有调查喔。\n那些都写在计划表上面了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eae1bf748102382af9d9f4090e74792aa8d515d111f7c30e323ef2eaa38f17f8", "ja": "（計画表？）", "zh": "（计划表？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "1cd946e4c976b77b29e2654c05069d6a8f92efd712e2808b2554f1c3a013866a", "ja": "今度の全体公演は、みんなとても楽しみにして\nいます。私もこの通り。……わくわく。", "zh": "大家都很期待这次的全体公演。\n如你所见，我也一样……（兴奋不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "f9d851fd23664ddab78bd04b79954d0d76ee703f67f33d10e6fbf6cec8932ad4", "ja": "なので、みんな準備万端なのです。ファンのみんなに、\nとびきり、きゅーと！な姿を見せたいのです♪", "zh": "所以大家的准备都很周全喔。\n为了向粉丝们展现出超级可爱的一面唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "619f18838c6a027b63faf758d6b49aba0e807b99caef6cf35546a20436379351", "ja": "ありさもです。ここに来てくれるお客さんは、きっと\nありさと同じくらい、アイドルちゃんが好きですから…", "zh": "亚利沙也是，因为来到这里的观众，\n一定也跟亚利沙一样，非常喜欢偶像宝贝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "f37003857a0241fb3881533e5ae5626ff9b8238013a32bfd9f89859a9d209863", "ja": "だから、ありさも精いっぱい頑張りますねっ。\nアイドルとして、夢をかなえるために……えへへ。", "zh": "所以亚利沙也会尽全力加油的！\n为了用一个偶像的身分，实现自己的梦想……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "44a266ff3c08e557e96aeba4045465ed65a6d3e55c3295684355e83acf9cb8d4", "ja": "ところで、私達には時間がありませんでした。\n徳川さん、松田さん、急ぎましょう。", "zh": "话说回来，都忘了我们还有事。\n德川姊、松田，快点出发吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4a859fa8bcae9b5b7704e9a477c274059130c52ba8d34a050eba3dd6e0834179", "ja": "おっと、そうだよな。3人とも、全体公演のための\nレッスンの後で、大変かもしれないけど……。", "zh": "哎呀，差点忘了。\n在全体公演的训练后，你们三个可能已经很累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1018_p", "source_sha256": "830b05e8777192aa2c72e452d384106fb1ee6cbc7eb43d0d8fe86198525d3285", "ja": "こういうロケも、大事な仕事なんだ。\n同行できなくて悪いけど、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "不过这种外景也是很重要的工作。\n抱歉没办法陪你们去，拜托你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "723f0ff5d6289c042ad926fc5cb2f9d3c2356b199fc4347d0c46ea3c18008927", "ja": "任せてください。もちろん今度の全体公演は、\nとても楽しみで大きな夢ですが……。", "zh": "请交给我们吧。\n这次的全体公演当然很令人期待，是一个很大的梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "e3b46819a9e78fdd2aa799aeff56ad30816ee339f7be4f4b89147dc05c4ebdcb", "ja": "今日のお仕事も、そんな夢のひとつなのです。\nわんだほー！に、サバイバルしてくるのですー！", "zh": "不过，今天的工作也是远大梦想中的一环喔。\n茉莉我们要去美妙地进行一场生存游戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "a6b34394d5f954626849cd0c170d9fa3fa80e886f0e1419e3b004b9f7b6ec98b", "ja": "では、バラエティ『夢のハワイ旅行争奪☆爆弾ガール』\nの収録に、いざ出陣です～！", "zh": "那么，我们就准备出发去拍摄综艺节目\n《梦想的夏威夷旅行争夺☆炸弹女孩》吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4f29a8b0213ae57722f9a7d2e37ad0a6886f3d540310c45204fb9339d09f6f93", "ja": "ケガしないように気をつけるんだぞ！\nでも、できれば夢をつかんでこい！", "zh": "你们要注意别受伤了喔！\n不过，尽可能去抓住梦想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7a71adbc3718da8bb63ec12b5e42c0f3466685783569af17568718308a201b7f", "ja": "（さて、レッスン組の様子は……）", "zh": "（接下来，训练组的状况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
