{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1026_p", "source_sha256": "763d33f1e346be1bd56c97f94c1565e2d5fcbe51c404e46efc0c73bfad30c115", "ja": "ああ、やっほー。こっちも頑張ってるみたいだな！\n……今はもしかして、休憩中か？", "zh": "嗯，嗨──看来你们也在努力啊！\n……现在应该是在休息？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
