{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "611c9b133505a6cd88bb383d02839c0e12c7510bd3871a02aacd676642252962", "ja": "いえ！　きちんと休憩を取ることも大事ですからね。\nずっと先に進むためにも！", "zh": "不客气！毕竟适时休息也很重要啊。\n休息是为了走更长远的路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "b3edbfb5d80fb8b43b355147f9c5e3649d4eade1cc876a9a8223272d205fdf97", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　{$P$}に、\nちょっと見てもらいたいものがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，对了对了！我有东西想请\n{$P$}帮忙看一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
