{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "b348dafd24213ab07700afb2af81bf68e2aab1c1bea6546226b43553e0bf30d9", "ja": "全体公演までの、自主練の計画表を作ってみたの。\nチェックしてもらえるかしら？", "zh": "我试做了一份至全体公演前的自主练习计划表。\n你能帮我检查一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1033_p", "source_sha256": "f19eec02c23f69ab3cf5c1a1e62914c3ed06e4e02de2757089f0b672a18775aa", "ja": "……すごい。タイムスケジュールまで、きちんと……\nなるほど、亜利沙が言ってたのはコレのことか。", "zh": "……好厉害，连时程表都排出来了……\n原来如此，亚利沙说的就是这个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1034_p", "source_sha256": "705af89f34d915b16f5a26aea26377f356b902a0fe9db4311d99a0296207a7d3", "ja": "これはもしかして、このみさんがひとりで？", "zh": "这不会是木实一个人写的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "10c5f020f60ee042d969d85d237ae7895598fa445db2cf25f2497ef75fa74eac", "ja": "ううん、みんなでよ！　みんなで作ったの♪", "zh": "不，是大家喔！我们大家一起排的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "4043d122d6b58d22757943e6f4e413e48f1ea2f359d9cd544c08ecad3150a686", "ja": "はいはーい！\n私もすっごく考えたんだよーっ！", "zh": "我也有我也有！\n我也一起想了很久喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "a165fcfb6f4779129dd6fc21e00d40ad51256d63297384873049659020670e54", "ja": "この日は筋トレと振り付けの確認！とか、\nこの日は筋トレとボイストレーニング！とか！", "zh": "像是这一天要练肌力跟确认舞步！\n还有这一天要练肌力跟做发声训练等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1038_p", "source_sha256": "d432efb33fde449efabe71984c7a3339016daaf3f985f3fceb6cd32b7ceba391", "ja": "筋トレはマストなんだな……。\nいや、えらいぞ海美！", "zh": "每天都练肌力啊……\n呃没事，海美你很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "c8b2ba6a2d378f433ed58449e4c89889a0b7e1c7375c64d92ebe889563311d74", "ja": "うんっ、ありがと{$P$}！\nえへへへ☆", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿嘿☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0954ece2614ad5423c5913304f82cc18308b8418c20ae2d31c84a3da94419249", "ja": "レッスンルームの時間割も、苦労したんだよね。\n全員がちゃんと使えるようにするのが大変でさ。", "zh": "安排练习室的时间表也花了不少工夫呢。\n要让所有人都能用到练习室真的不容易。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "3c1119229703c431a909795c1e7ac22e3a9869ea41b09a63d906f4de691e292e", "ja": "みんなでしっかりレッスンして、公演の日に\n私達のピークが来るようにって考えてみたんです。", "zh": "我们打算一起认真练习，希望在公演那天，\n大家的状态能达到巅峰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "d5f6fe3266ab0900ca61f83b7c9d4ee5aeefddabdd9e76c803bdbc0c1dd6bea8", "ja": "私達が全員、限界まで力を出し切ることができたら\n……本当に、最高のステージができると思って！", "zh": "要是我们全部都可以将能力发挥到极限……\n一定能打造出最棒的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "54875c69ccb6ccf4bcfb1ac4a8ea535b788a5f7b514b6d904bece4b4159dee4b", "ja": "どうかしら？　気になるところがあったら、\n遠慮しないで言って欲しいんだけど……。", "zh": "怎么样？如果有奇怪的地方，\n希望你能直说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e07d04c4251cfd482f974c29437e414a27c395b5af9069018a6179adfb714b3d", "ja": "いえ、マジメな話、バッチリだと思います。\n俺もこのスケジュールを頭に入れておきますね！", "zh": "不，说真的，我觉得很完美。\n我也把这份行程表记在脑中吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "37a8a74defe72d21040f78be637e53405eeed55324bc69cf193e09ce85cdeec3", "ja": "本当？　フフッ、ありがと、{$P$}。\nそれじゃあみんな、レッスンを再開しましょう！", "zh": "真的吗？呵呵，谢谢你，{$P$}。\n那么大家，我们继续训练课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1046_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1047_042miy", "source_sha256": "8b50ae918e0968b77a487c4afc4a337fe786af52ea0ce2d1e117e97ce91ebcbe", "ja": "お～。みなさん、おそろいですな～。\nダンスには間に合ったみたいで、よかったです～。", "zh": "哦～大家都在这里耶～\n太好了，看来有赶上跳舞的时间～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1048_p", "source_sha256": "5d818c79da6eb5de53983b3031169bc54cf05f9af5a071e9aef8ce709824d986", "ja": "お疲れ様。美也はここから合流ってことか。", "zh": "辛苦你了。美也，你是接下来才要加入大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1049_042miy", "source_sha256": "bfbf1802c9fc9536a617b8df6122cf317e06ace15b13734b2e5235f42e719dab", "ja": "はい～、進路調査票を再提出していたら、\nこんな時間になってしまいました～。", "zh": "是的～我去重新缴交志愿调查表，\n没想到过来就这么晚了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "ca17074f5768a09049ef3eeea053cf55c3612771d2ce9eee27142de01335ac46", "ja": "結局『歴史に残るアイドル』以外、思い付かなくて……\n先生とお話をしてきましたよ～。", "zh": "结果除了『名留青史的偶像』以外，我真的想不到\n要写什么……所以就跟老师谈了一下喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "9bbedd5750d2f4c007cca9516e865c07f38feac39894398351aad0665c5da47a", "ja": "それで？\n先生、なんだって？", "zh": "结果呢？\n老师怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1052_042miy", "source_sha256": "4b3ac59011afdb8eebf491b1a966f7e961114ba921d7f9007380fb6df8c98fe9", "ja": "いっぱいお話をさせてもらって、「夢を叶えろよ」って\n言ってもらえました。ふふふ～、やりましたな～。", "zh": "我们聊了很多，最后老师跟我说「去实现你的梦想吧」。\n呵呵呵～太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1053_p", "source_sha256": "e37c1b3fff2fc5e9b758eab045fc09074ba6ce6680838c16342301f7bd553869", "ja": "進路に夢、か。美也の熱意が伝わったんだな。\nよかったな美也！", "zh": "在志愿表上写梦想啊，看来老师感受到美也的热忱了呢。\n太好了，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "37079206a2db484d5b5b50a63e35c23782cbd13f1fc0e8fa9efe45c73caa6b58", "ja": "はい～。とってもうれしかったので、\n新しいお茶っ葉を持ってきましたよ～。", "zh": "对啊～因为我实在太高兴，\n就带了新的茶叶过来喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1055_042miy", "source_sha256": "08d719d20101be7f4a9da94b736e025954afc10e3fc23f3b953947013498ba4e", "ja": "ダンスのレッスンが終わったら淹れますので、\nみなさん、一緒にいただきましょ～。", "zh": "舞蹈训练结束后我会去泡茶，\n大家一起喝吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1056_039kon", "source_sha256": "4983b75dfc3d34105fb9a47e3ace22edb6504d64034e7e71cfe0ac1962dd7ab8", "ja": "美也ちゃん、お茶、ごちそうさま♪\nとってもおいしかったわ！", "zh": "美也，谢谢你的茶♪\n非常好喝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1057_042miy", "source_sha256": "03661655a42c54bc2245f146999a61479011dfb5902a5b87449fd22d9e555b61", "ja": "むふふ～。\n喜んでもらえたみたいで、よかったです～。", "zh": "呵呵～\n大家喜欢就好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1058_029umi", "source_sha256": "7dc724a242294bebd799123b25f6827de7befeb8a571c737d0cfb99c25938376", "ja": "そういえば美也、さっきなんの話してたの？\n先生とお話、とか……。", "zh": "话说回来，美也，你们刚刚在说什么啊？\n跟老师聊什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1059_042miy", "source_sha256": "eac63fa203c8faa2dffeb53d6a1f8057b7965df35cd8301644ecb0c223b3d0ed", "ja": "お～。そういえば、海美ちゃんと歩さんには、\nまだ聞いてませんでしたね～。", "zh": "哦～这么说来，\n还没问过海美跟步姊呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1060_042miy", "source_sha256": "de16c5c92c23eb0e217bc417c7d2166821005ec57b471b6cf71d243a42f927d5", "ja": "おふたりの夢は、なんですか～？", "zh": "请问你们的梦想是什么～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1061_034ayu", "source_sha256": "227d77d19570e3805361d452c819ebb76e75818fc2db2929c53304c1fc34fe70", "ja": "えっ、ずいぶん急な質問だな……。\nアタシ達の夢って？", "zh": "呃，这个问题也太突然了……\n为什么这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1062_027say", "source_sha256": "1e55a911795073f3bd05d826b39748d5a265f17677c532b994ce3ca7bcf06f25", "ja": "学校の進路調査の参考にしたいって、前に私とこのみ\nさんと{$P$}も聞かれたんです。", "zh": "她说想问我们，当作学校志愿调查的参考，之前\n我跟木实姊还有{$P$}都被问过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1063_027say", "source_sha256": "c5764f0bd9cbba5ab400d2526c28ca240bc5713644c2d667d3ec97b8dba17c43", "ja": "私の夢は、もちろん……トップアイドルです！", "zh": "我的梦想当然是……顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1064_039kon", "source_sha256": "f0b26f0bc72879e0522688f37e162d2cb18f5c378761d8b9c6a25441d0df8e54", "ja": "そして私の夢は、トップセクシーアイドルよ♪", "zh": "而我的梦想是，顶尖性感偶像喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1065_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5592f79197cf8d85d7181b0c3dc9f29ca380643341b10d93e3b7564084ec84af", "ja": "そういうことか。なら、アタシの夢はもちろん、\nダンスでナンバーワンのアイドルになること！", "zh": "原来是这样。\n那么，我的梦想当然是用舞技成为No.1的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1066_029umi", "source_sha256": "2e99c7a765a9599ce2ac59449e98dc4906fc4c0ea0f028448438f98f0b73cf79", "ja": "私の夢は……うんっ、アイドルになること！\n……って、あれっ！？　もう叶っちゃってる！？", "zh": "我的梦想……嗯，就是成为偶像！\n……呃，咦！？已经实现了耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1067_p", "source_sha256": "979a96e0ba9dd97bfe083306a8898ee75ffbce100cd3b7de87e060792a12240d", "ja": "はは、それなら海美は、\n次の夢に向かって進んでるところ……って感じかな？", "zh": "哈哈，那么海美应该正在往\n下一个梦想前进……是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1068_029umi", "source_sha256": "e2594c4cd004b3e16116e710c85722326ead9ceb38052b346b67b56597066a93", "ja": "次の夢に……うん、そうかも！\nそれってなんか、ワクワクするねっ☆", "zh": "往下一个梦想……嗯，应该是这样！\n这么说令人有点兴奋呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1069_042miy", "source_sha256": "491fb42a31d8ebf74a17622a374b2959ee52e296ef3315e5a8b4b163c8e8d81f", "ja": "なるほど～。\nみなさん、違う夢を持っているんですな～。", "zh": "原来如此～\n大家都拥有不同的梦想呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1070_039kon", "source_sha256": "2fac20d2ea142bd0e425998e8ea412d381067787c67cf7d0cbd54b430805a607", "ja": "ウフフ、面白いわね。みんな同じアイドルなのに、\n追ってる夢が全然違うなんて。", "zh": "呵呵，真有趣。\n明明大家同样都是偶像，追逐的梦想却完全不同呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1071_p", "source_sha256": "a6cb5d16ea117a0b26e85fb81bdd07dcf047f386e89d33dc5e4b7adb463d3684", "ja": "そうですね。それぞれが、いろんな夢を胸に、\nアイドルの世界に飛び込んでくれたんだと思います。", "zh": "对啊，每个人应该都是分别怀着各种梦想，\n跳进偶像世界里的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1072_p", "source_sha256": "c25c19bda4acfbdf289f09fde4a61ce395a06a5021027dbbb2c50f29c1a48bf6", "ja": "でも……たどり着く場所は、\nみんな同じですから。", "zh": "不过……\n所有人最终抵达的地方都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1073_027say", "source_sha256": "c15c58b05412517cdec3aae24aa3e60835c96317d7ac0fe2af92e8aa13a41f64", "ja": "たどり着く場所……？", "zh": "最终抵达的地方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1074_039kon", "source_sha256": "bee466fc5bb0e3ade2aa409aa591b32f4f043e79d1e98f214d838799fd81f091", "ja": "{$P$}、それって……\nあっ、そっか！", "zh": "{$P$}，你是指……\n啊，原来如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1075_039kon", "source_sha256": "1f5af8a145ca57cc39b76a6d1d7d98fc77f40d89827018fbff36ee69c05c3a15", "ja": "ステージね！？", "zh": "是舞台对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1076_042miy", "source_sha256": "d2a64b8c9187fc21e2ee098c13321b452e4f936f1d715fa91271b4b82c5db310", "ja": "ステージですね～。", "zh": "是舞台呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
