{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1078_034ayu", "source_sha256": "14996e9d4d97bcb2b550d8e2da980fe5a3bec92fc67145a6509a67fdafccaaff", "ja": "ステージだ！", "zh": "是舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1079_029umi", "source_sha256": "14996e9d4d97bcb2b550d8e2da980fe5a3bec92fc67145a6509a67fdafccaaff", "ja": "ステージだ！", "zh": "是舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1080_p", "source_sha256": "7cd0369561471b3974a8a0ad6481715f296f8555e59dd98445e16e3290435f28", "ja": "そう、いろんな夢を抱いたアイドルのみんな、\n全員がたどり着く場所。それがステージです。", "zh": "没错，心怀各种梦想的偶像们，\n你们所有人最终抵达的地方，就是舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1081_p", "source_sha256": "a378ed88822d1762ba485d0a28e4928afa0791fc990a397dd74d34f17cab0dcc", "ja": "みんなの夢がステージの上で混ざり合って、\n最高に輝いていく。だから……。", "zh": "大家的梦想在舞台上交织相融，\n绽放出最闪耀的光芒，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1082_p", "source_sha256": "aba29c90bbd7b66a6dc5195eb460b4045dc6464d9815cd7e40a7ca07dfa1b2e2", "ja": "ステージはあんなにも色鮮やかで、\nまぶしいんじゃないかなと……。", "zh": "舞台才会那么色彩斑斓、\n耀眼夺目吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1083_039kon", "source_sha256": "de57be23327de86219d043608dda372b21c5ea08f50857851f13e596eba65eae", "ja": "フフッ、そうね。アイドルは、みんな同じ……。\n夢をかなえるために、ステージに立つのよね♪", "zh": "呵呵，对啊，所有的偶像都一样……\n是为了实现梦想而站上舞台的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1084_027say", "source_sha256": "1b0d873d9797b8355c35307bac4a44c8d4b4fdbbc25f6acdd4fbe80fe96f05a0", "ja": "そうですよね！　ステージで夢をかなえて……\n輝いてこそ、アイドルなんですね！", "zh": "说得对！正因为是在舞台上实现梦想……\n发光发热，才是偶像嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1085_p", "source_sha256": "1c63ddb80814eb036dda68c81242ca04dd74b5425663120096588069f1effcfd", "ja": "ああ。今度の全体公演では、きっと最高の輝きを\n見せてもらえると思ってる。楽しみにしてるぞ！", "zh": "是啊，我想这次的全体公演，\n你们一定能够展现出最耀眼的光芒，我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1086_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a6fb61b4513ff42c541d8570e5ea70d770dabfb0203480804e974a859927454", "ja": "うんっ、任せて！\n私、ピッカピカに輝いてみせるからねっ！", "zh": "嗯，交给我们吧！\n我会表现得超级闪亮喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1087_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6e003e253a6d08d29c8c23ea1ff84acd7c99d3a021109fc1bda27fa2cb5bea50", "ja": "へへっ、それじゃ競争だな。\n誰が1番輝けるか！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那就来比赛吧，\n看谁最亮眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1088_029umi", "source_sha256": "cce5987dc325ccc80886042f16d84d6edcc02a8bd9392b21a774cc0d004a52eb", "ja": "ううん、みんなで1番になろうよ！\nだって、みんなで上がるステージだもんね！", "zh": "不，大家一起成为最耀眼的存在吧！\n毕竟我们要一起站上舞台啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1089_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9f2ee7b4ff2e228bf1ecbbcd02d131831bac5e881a5d02aaa5a916b3f649d580", "ja": "ええっ！？　みんながナンバーワンってこと？\nうーん……ま、いっか！　せっかくの全体公演だし！", "zh": "咦咦！？所以是大家一起成为No.1吗？\n唔……算了！毕竟是难得的全体公演嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1090_042miy", "source_sha256": "3afff6aaf2309760831b446b7cc86b1b78f47942fa8772171272f46adc574496", "ja": "ふふふ～♪　きっと素敵な公演になりますね～。\nよかったら、お茶をどうぞ～。", "zh": "呵呵呵～♪这场公演一定会很精采的～\n不嫌弃的话，请用茶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1091_027say", "source_sha256": "1b312c972d6c8216059ea32f705b40ebab60961980d598f5b86f2bfbafad1abe", "ja": "あれ、美也さん？\nわざわざ淹れに行ってくれたの？", "zh": "咦，美也？\n你刚刚特别去泡的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1092_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee36fd50c88069204a6f27394922230b851160361e6a9d8cb5e5a727620a42af", "ja": "はい～。みなさんの夢を、たくさん教えてもらいました\nから、お礼にと思って。そしたら……。", "zh": "是的～大家都告诉我这么多自己的梦想了，\n我想答谢一下，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1093_042miy", "source_sha256": "1b45d90fd8a4d23ab92ed17f6266d1093988063298470d63dd071f49fb84d894", "ja": "ほら、茶柱がたくさん立ったんです～。\n公演も、きっと大成功間違いなしですね～♪", "zh": "你们看，有好多茶梗立起来了呢～\n看来公演也一定会很成功的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1094_039kon", "source_sha256": "0d31e5edb8bf08abeef75ecb403fdc0eac60d9ef4f7b7e1f5378c47fd9c0ee55", "ja": "ウフフ、きっとそうね♪　ありがとう、美也ちゃん。\n幸先も、すっかりいいことだし……。", "zh": "呵呵，一定会成功吧♪谢谢你，美也。\n而且也出现了好预兆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1095_039kon", "source_sha256": "0d480e14bcb8be5b0f68a2ad8748dcdbcb83194b12ff3ae7f7c65fef54266ebc", "ja": "みんな！　今回の公演、必ず成功させましょうね！", "zh": "各位！我们一定要让这次的公演成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1096_027say", "source_sha256": "a583ab7c75e6dc25bbfcb2f70a4dc0343c02525d567cf7bb332e6fb2bf4273a5", "ja": "はい！　それぞれの夢を叶えるためにも！", "zh": "是！这也是为了实现大家的梦想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1097_034ayu", "source_sha256": "335ba0b4cba4aa82e5fb37ff4c304afd8557e6177d8d65630c5e4673a67e6018", "ja": "よーし、燃えてきた！\nナンバーワンのダンスで、輝いてみせるよ！", "zh": "好啊，我的斗志燃烧起来了！\n我会用No.1的舞技来发光发热！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1098_029umi", "source_sha256": "90ffcce9aa3d5f7053bdf1973a37833b40f48e844be669399e6f9f404faf5e84", "ja": "私も！　キラキラのピカピカになるっ！\n{$P$}、しっかり見ててねーっ！", "zh": "我也一样！要变得一闪一闪亮晶晶！\n{$P$}，请好好看着我喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1099_p", "source_sha256": "d226abc9320d416d6135e348901cad09a920b0b4ae66d3b159dcfecec84fddb2", "ja": "（それぞれの夢を追いかけるアイドル達。\nでも、みんなの気持ちはひとつだ！）", "zh": "（偶像们分别追寻着各自的梦想。\n不过，大家是一体同心的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_030_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_030_1100_p", "source_sha256": "205349798fa3dd83d18b21d4c83db48ecaac5681f0fdaccbee7f058f0766c558", "ja": "（彼女達は既に輝き始めている。きっとステージの\n上でも、鮮やかな七色の輝きを放ってくれるだろう）", "zh": "（她们已经开始发光发热了。\n站上舞台后，一定也会绽放出七彩斑斓的光芒吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
